### 아고라 토큰 발급 테스트
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/lesson/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "channelName": "test-001",
  "uid": "0",
  "role": "PUBLISHER"
}

### SUBSCRIBER 역할 테스트
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/lesson/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "channelName": "test-001",
  "uid": "1",
  "role": "SUBSCRIBER"
}

### 채널명 없을 때 에러 테스트
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/lesson/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "channelName": "",
  "uid": "0",
  "role": "PUBLISHER"
}